      "updated": 1793443131772,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. user upload pdf/doc/txt/etc\n\n2. files saved to uploads/\n\n3. text extracted and chunked\n\n4. Embeddings via Gemini\n\n5. stored in ChromaDB\n\n6. Query via RAG tool at chat \ntime",
