      "updated": 1793443087890,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. User sends message + thread_id + model\n\n2. FastAPI saves messages to Sqllite\n\n3. Langgraph agents streams response\n\n4. LLM decides: answer or call tools\n\n5. Tool fetch RAG / memory / Web data\n\n6.  Token streamed back via SSE\n\n7. Find answer save to Sqllite",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User sends message + thread_id + model\n\n2. FastAPI saves messages to Sqllite\n\n3. Langgraph agents streams response\n\n4. LLM decides: answer or call tools\n\n5. Tool fetch RAG / memory / Web data\n\n6.  Token streamed back via SSE\n\n7. Find answer save to Sqllite",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
